# Copy this file to .env, in this folder, and paste your key in.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Get a key free from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# This one is a SECRET, unlike the app's Clerk publishable key. It is billable
# and it must never reach the phone: anything named EXPO_PUBLIC_* is inlined
# into the app bundle at build time and can be read out of a shipped app. That
# is exactly why the Gemini call lives in this service instead of in the app.
#
# service/.env is gitignored. Do not commit it, and do not paste the key into
# chat, a screenshot, or the project README.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
